"<!-- release-status: publish-failed was-prerelease=false -->\n> [!CAUTION]\n> **This release did not publish.** These jobs did not succeed:\n> verify-npm (failure).\n>\n> The tag and whatever assets are attached are all that exists of\n> `v0.38.0` — the registries do not serve it. Tags here are\n> immutable, so the recovery is to fix the failure and let release-plz\n> cut the next patch version.\n<!-- release-status: end -->\n\n### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the engine that copies a private source's documents ([#351](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/351))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* adopt the engine that copies a private source's documents ([#348](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/348))\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/releases/414446810","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/releases/414446810/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/releases/414446810/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/releases/tag/v0.37.0","id":414446810,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickde